<title>USA: Reynolds Metals Co Q3 net dropped.</title>
<headline>Reynolds Metals Co Q3 net dropped.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.26		    $1.56</p>
<p> Net			 26,000		  112,000</p>
<p> Revs		   1,757,000		1,845,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  63,679		   72,483</p>
<p>		     Nine Months</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.95		    $4.20</p>
<p> Net			 88,000		  305,000</p>
<p> Revs		   5,267,000		5,380,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  63,650		   72,589</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: First Call consensus estimate was $0.51/shr.</p>
<p>1996 Q3 net includes gain of $6 million, or $0.10/shr, from LIFO inventory liquidations.</p>
<p>1996 nine mths net also includes charges of $37 million pretax for restructuring costs and $15 million, or $0.24, after tax for cumulative effect of accounting change.</p>
<p>1995 average shares outstanding include common share equivalents of 9.0 million in qtr and 9.7 million in nine mths. Not included in 1996 as the effect would have been anti-dilutive.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
